{
 "_about": "The WWII pack's system pictures (tools/look/make_ww2_flags.py): each system flies the flag it flew in 1941, fixed like a planet's artwork - its own where it had one, else its sovereign's (Gibraltar the United Kingdom's, Sicily Italy's, Siberia the Soviet Union's). Germany flies the black-white-red tricolour: no Nazi symbols in the game at all (TeeJ, 2026-09-29). `flags`: the Wikimedia Commons file of each - its page, its SVG's address and SHA-1 as Commons publishes them, the PNG Commons renders from it (and that PNG's SHA-256), its licence. `systems`: which flag each system flies, and why.",
